==== Serial ====
-> [[docs:techref:hardware:port.serial]] general information about the serial port, serial port cable, etc.

The module has two serial ports. The openwrt serial console is available by default only on UART2.

^ Label on EVB   ^ device       ^
| UART1          | /dev/ttyS0   |
| UART2          | /dev/ttyS1   |


^ Serial connection parameters\\ for WIZnet WizFi630A | 115200, 8N1 only on UART2|

